<title>JAPAN: Brother -96/97 parent forecast.</title>
<headline>Brother -96/97 parent forecast.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Four months to March 31, 1997</p>
<p>		   (in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p>			   LATEST	    PREVIOUS	   ACTUAL</p>
<p> (Parent)	     FORECAST	   FORECAST	  YEAR-AGO</p>
<p> Sales		 67.00		60.00	     166.38</p>
<p> Current		3.60		 1.20		 4.83</p>
<p> Net		    1.70		 1.00		 3.44</p>
<p> Ord div		1.80 yen				  5.00 yen</p>
<p> -Special div	 0.70 yen		-</p>
<p>NOTE - Brother Industries Ltd is a maker of sewing machines</p>
<p>and typewriters. The latest forecasts are for the four-month</p>
<p>period from November 21, 1996 to March 31, 1997. The actual</p>
<p>year-ago results are for the full year ending March 31,</p>
<p>1996, since the company changed its business term.</p>
